This story is a work of fiction.

00:01:33.940 --> 00:01:37.440
September, 1590 - Kyoto - Jurakudai

00:01:53.950 --> 00:02:00.660
You will give me that Hashitate tea pot, the famed treasure of simplicity, to me.

00:02:02.820 --> 00:02:04.160
And one more thing...

00:02:05.140 --> 00:02:08.520
You will give me your daughter, Ogin.

00:02:12.610 --> 00:02:17.550
By taking his daughter as hostage, we can stop Master Rikyū's reckless ambitions.

00:02:26.670 --> 00:02:30.650
Not just that. My days are numbered.

00:02:31.050 --> 00:02:35.180
It's about time I bear a child healthier than Tsurumatsu.

00:02:36.230 --> 00:02:38.490
The Crybaby Under the Sun

00:02:56.830 --> 00:03:01.750
Becoming the Chief Advisor's mistress... What should I do, Father?

00:03:02.350 --> 00:03:05.660
A pointless question. Refuse him immediately.

00:03:06.170 --> 00:03:09.120
I will not give him the Hashitate tea pot, either.

00:03:09.520 --> 00:03:11.670
Your life is in danger, then.

00:03:11.990 --> 00:03:15.880
What about giving him the tea pot in exchange for Ogin?

00:03:16.110 --> 00:03:18.540
Do you want me to lose, Oriki?

00:03:19.160 --> 00:03:24.290
Even my own wife wants me to keep prostrating towards the Chief Advisor.

00:03:26.360 --> 00:03:27.800
I will not compromise.

00:03:36.500 --> 00:03:40.400
I will not lose, even if it means losing my life.

00:03:43.810 --> 00:03:46.940
I am also a woman of tea.

00:03:47.410 --> 00:03:52.680
I understand that your determination stems not only from hate.

00:03:53.500 --> 00:03:58.820
To have the worth of your entire life be looked down upon and having to bottle up that feeling...

00:03:58.980 --> 00:04:02.810
That means you are not a man anymore, and only a walking corpse.

00:04:07.460 --> 00:04:11.800
No need to give him the tea pot. I'll go to the Chief Advisor's side.

00:04:14.660 --> 00:04:15.650
Ogin!

00:04:21.060 --> 00:04:26.400
I am the daughter of Matsunaga Hisahide. When my father died,

00:04:26.550 --> 00:04:33.470
you secretly took me in and raised me. I was weak and had nothing.

00:04:34.430 --> 00:04:36.690
My husband passed away before me,

00:04:37.050 --> 00:04:39.750
but I had the joy of being his wife.

00:04:41.330 --> 00:04:45.180
I won't have another chance like this to pay you back.

00:04:45.400 --> 00:04:47.750
I don't need you to pay back anything. I won't let you go!

00:04:48.430 --> 00:04:51.890
If you are to die because of this,

00:04:52.110 --> 00:04:55.680
then the world will never truly attain imperfection.

00:04:58.030 --> 00:05:01.220
I will become the Chief Advisor's mistress.

00:05:01.530 --> 00:05:04.230
Please think of this as the chance of a lifetime.

00:05:07.900 --> 00:05:14.730
I will make sure to lead him to his death.

00:05:23.530 --> 00:05:28.860
Even if you are my father, you cannot stop the blood of a traitor flowing within me.

00:05:36.400 --> 00:05:37.860
Ogin!

00:06:35.320 --> 00:06:39.530
I have finally turned into the devil.

00:06:40.200 --> 00:06:43.700
End of September, 1590 - Kyoto - Jurakudai - Sen no Rikyū's residence

00:06:57.970 --> 00:07:00.450
I think it should be a bit sweeter.

00:07:00.810 --> 00:07:04.280
Our guest in the morning is Lord Ōtomo Yoshimune, right?

00:07:04.460 --> 00:07:05.160
Yes.

00:07:05.550 --> 00:07:09.070
Kyushu's tastes are somewhat sweet.

00:07:09.330 --> 00:07:13.020
Thank you for the nice thrush.

00:07:13.970 --> 00:07:18.140
It's nothing. I just wanted some bird soup.

00:07:18.470 --> 00:07:20.720
I don't remember inviting you.

00:07:32.550 --> 00:07:35.490
I cannot back down here.

00:07:36.980 --> 00:07:40.640
Sorry, I know you are a busy man.

00:07:40.900 --> 00:07:43.180
But there are a few things I want you to see.

00:07:43.600 --> 00:07:46.480
I didn't want to come empty-handed, so I brought some thrush.

00:07:50.990 --> 00:07:53.870
You must treat all guests with respect, even those you don't like.

00:07:54.090 --> 00:07:55.690
That's the way of a tea master, I take it?

00:08:19.380 --> 00:08:21.450
Let me tell you this beforehand.

00:08:22.400 --> 00:08:25.660
In the future, I will not think of you as my disciple.

00:08:27.040 --> 00:08:31.100
And you will not think of me as your master.

00:08:39.370 --> 00:08:40.650
All right.

00:08:41.100 --> 00:08:45.610
I don't know what you are thinking,

00:08:45.840 --> 00:08:50.160
but Ogin has been kidnapped to become the Chief Advisor's mistress.

00:08:52.690 --> 00:08:55.290
It's only natural for you to cut off your connections.

00:08:57.050 --> 00:09:01.300
But please take a look at this tea bowl.

00:09:02.290 --> 00:09:05.510
This Shino tea bowl I worked so hard on!

00:09:09.840 --> 00:09:13.970
I am pleased that you are able to reach such a level.

00:09:16.590 --> 00:09:22.300
I was the pioneer in making Goryeo Ido tea bowls the peak of imperfection.

00:09:22.990 --> 00:09:25.540
I eliminated all of the extras.

00:09:25.970 --> 00:09:28.890
Pure black became the very essense.

00:09:29.600 --> 00:09:37.600
You took the extras I got rid of, the decorations and the pride,

00:09:37.970 --> 00:09:41.050
and painted them directly onto the bowl with an imperfect brush.

00:09:41.320 --> 00:09:44.000
Thus, creating a new style.

00:09:45.770 --> 00:09:51.300
I also feel you have not committed yourself fully into this tea bowl.

00:09:56.720 --> 00:10:00.600
What is it that you want to tell the world?

00:10:03.510 --> 00:10:07.760
What do you expect to happen by creating this?

00:10:16.020 --> 00:10:19.780
If you do not know the answers, then the very act of creation is futile.

00:10:19.920 --> 00:10:22.800
You cannot affect the hearts of people.

00:10:32.710 --> 00:10:35.240
Please reexamine yourself.

00:10:37.800 --> 00:10:40.850
Reexamine and delete...

00:10:46.250 --> 00:10:48.760
And what's left will be...

00:10:52.700 --> 00:10:58.870
Something that can be under the name of Furuori and open up the true door to imperfection.

00:11:08.600 --> 00:11:12.520
What is it that you want to tell the world?

00:11:14.250 --> 00:11:18.450
Why did you create this? What is the point?

00:11:19.800 --> 00:11:25.910
It hurts... Like a needle straight into my gut.

00:11:31.850 --> 00:11:37.150
He's right... I only wanted to sit on top of the throne of aesthetes.

00:11:41.370 --> 00:11:43.550
But the fact is, I am empty inside.

00:11:45.920 --> 00:11:49.420
End of October, 1590 - Mutsu Province - Shimokusa Castle 

00:11:51.370 --> 00:11:54.670
Milord! Date's army is inside the castle.

00:11:55.250 --> 00:11:59.230
I think he's trying to give weapons to the citizenry.

00:11:59.600 --> 00:12:01.700
I, Ujisato, find it hard to understand his actions.

00:12:02.110 --> 00:12:04.710
The Chief Advisor brought peace to Ōu.

00:12:05.100 --> 00:12:07.420
I have been transferred to Aizu.

00:12:07.860 --> 00:12:10.590
What do the citizens of Ōu want, exactly?

00:12:11.000 --> 00:12:14.990
Are they going to be against the Chief Advisor to the bitter end?

00:12:15.450 --> 00:12:18.700
Is this Date's plot?

00:12:18.900 --> 00:12:21.370
This meeting will answer our questions.

00:12:22.860 --> 00:12:25.070
Date will be welcoming us at the tea room.

00:12:25.270 --> 00:12:27.060
Be mindful of your words.

00:12:28.220 --> 00:12:32.070
We should be careful when dealing with Gamō.

00:12:32.180 --> 00:12:37.960
On the surface we are following the Chief Advisor, but we're actually giving weapons to the citizenry.

00:12:38.040 --> 00:12:40.800
You must keep that a secret.

00:12:40.880 --> 00:12:43.320
I know, Katakura.

00:12:44.690 --> 00:12:48.300
But there's something that annoys me.

00:12:48.840 --> 00:12:51.070
That damn Gamō.

00:12:51.460 --> 00:12:58.640
He is the son-in-law of the only warrior I respect, Oda Nobunaga.

00:13:07.040 --> 00:13:09.560
Thank you for coming all the way here from Aizu.

00:13:09.860 --> 00:13:11.990
Have you gotten used to the water here?

00:13:12.890 --> 00:13:19.390
Not really. I'll probably be used to it after we're done making sure the citizens aren't rebelling.

00:13:20.270 --> 00:13:23.850
Are you saying the citizens need to be stopped because of me?

00:13:24.620 --> 00:13:28.910
I'm busy here trying to survey the land and confiscate their weapons.

00:13:30.700 --> 00:13:34.420
All because of some order from that snot-faced Ishida Mitsunari.

00:13:34.660 --> 00:13:37.090
He's been on my ass all day.

00:13:37.760 --> 00:13:41.810
And here you are, understanding nothing.

00:13:42.140 --> 00:13:45.820
I guess being the son-in-law of Oda Nobunaga is a joke?

00:13:46.280 --> 00:13:50.130
I respect Lord Nobunaga more than any other warrior.

00:13:50.450 --> 00:13:54.870
You've never even met him before, so how can you understand him?

00:13:55.030 --> 00:13:58.650
My entire life mirrored Nobunaga.

00:13:59.180 --> 00:14:05.070
I killed my younger brother, sent my mother into exile, and became the ultimate ruler.

00:14:05.580 --> 00:14:10.460
My life is quite different from some rich brat raised in paradise.

00:14:15.350 --> 00:14:19.130
He's turning his back on me. What disrepect.

00:14:25.510 --> 00:14:26.890
In any case,

00:14:27.310 --> 00:14:29.560
he's barely over twenty years old.

00:14:29.760 --> 00:14:33.020
He has never been taught by Master Rikyū.

00:14:33.250 --> 00:14:37.030
I'll just think of his words as mere jokes.

00:14:40.130 --> 00:14:41.390
All right. Drink up.

00:14:53.190 --> 00:14:55.860
Too fucking bitter!

00:14:56.440 --> 00:15:00.580
Die! Gamō! Die of thirst!

00:15:00.720 --> 00:15:02.910
Are you trying to poison me, you bastard!?

00:15:03.070 --> 00:15:05.840
I only put in five times the powder!

00:15:05.940 --> 00:15:08.350
What a waste to serve it to you, though!

00:15:16.160 --> 00:15:17.630
What's going on here!?

00:15:20.920 --> 00:15:22.200
They're going crazy!

00:15:22.300 --> 00:15:26.500
Lord Gamō! Lord Masamune! They're going at it!

00:15:43.780 --> 00:15:45.960
We've finished the land survey of Enokidomura.

00:15:46.880 --> 00:15:49.420
We may not be under the direct control of Toyotomi,

00:15:49.580 --> 00:15:52.060
but it makes me depressed to know that these taxes aren't going to us.

00:15:52.440 --> 00:15:57.230
Lord Ishida is still in Ōu. He's probably dealing with some sort of problem.

00:15:57.450 --> 00:16:02.550
He won't be back any time soon, so we can pocket Toyotomi's share.

00:16:03.350 --> 00:16:06.670
Seems like you've made more tea bowls to sell at Kyoto.

00:16:07.050 --> 00:16:11.860
If they sell well, we can use the money to fund the invasion of China.

00:16:15.420 --> 00:16:21.680
These bowls are B-grade, not A-grade.

00:16:24.370 --> 00:16:28.490
Or perhaps I'm still B-grade myself.

00:16:30.460 --> 00:16:33.090
What am I worth, exactly?

00:16:33.220 --> 00:16:36.720
Beginning of November, 1590 - Kyoto - Jurakudai

00:16:39.150 --> 00:16:42.960
Thank you for coming all the way here from Korea, Lord Hwang.

00:16:43.910 --> 00:16:49.980
No banquet and only a tea ceremony? Is this a joke?

00:16:51.500 --> 00:16:53.480
His Highness is here.

00:16:56.910 --> 00:17:00.380
Oh, welcome, welcome.

00:17:00.900 --> 00:17:02.120
Thank you for waiting.

00:17:02.210 --> 00:17:03.490
Right, Tsurumatsu?

00:17:05.670 --> 00:17:09.980
I'm sure the men from Tsushima have told you my intentions.

00:17:10.140 --> 00:17:13.290
Let me hear the Emperor of Korea's answer.

00:17:15.810 --> 00:17:25.680
Our Emperor says that he is pleased for such a chaotic country to finally be united as one.

00:17:26.280 --> 00:17:30.070
Huh? That's it?

00:17:31.030 --> 00:17:34.530
We are here only to congratulate you.

00:17:34.840 --> 00:17:35.780
Oh?

00:17:37.720 --> 00:17:42.780
I am not stopping at Japan. I plan to unite China and India.

00:17:43.510 --> 00:17:46.410
For that purpose, Korea needs to be under my rule.

00:17:46.550 --> 00:17:49.750
And set the example for the others.

00:17:55.260 --> 00:17:57.610
We've never about that.

00:17:58.120 --> 00:18:05.500
Even if you tell us your intentions, our nation will not agree to such idiotic terms.

00:18:05.800 --> 00:18:06.970
What!?

00:18:17.990 --> 00:18:20.420
Please have some tea.

00:18:21.340 --> 00:18:23.210
This is an Ido tea bowl from Korea.

00:18:25.110 --> 00:18:29.360
Does this nation only have such crude wares to show off to guests?

00:18:31.380 --> 00:18:33.740
We bring gifts, too.

00:18:36.500 --> 00:18:42.500
This is what we use. Pure white, top-quality porcelain wares.

00:18:43.120 --> 00:18:48.950
Not only is your service terrible, you brought forth outrageous requests.

00:18:49.190 --> 00:18:54.150
I felt like my long journey from Korea has been a waste of time.

00:18:54.470 --> 00:19:00.040
I heard that you worked very hard to come to where you are today, Lord Toyotomi.

00:19:00.400 --> 00:19:05.480
If you want to rule the world, then you should learn some decorum first.

00:19:05.530 --> 00:19:06.440
That's enough!

00:19:09.270 --> 00:19:10.470
Back down!

00:19:17.180 --> 00:19:20.960
I will reply to your emperor later.

00:19:21.940 --> 00:19:23.910
But remember this.

00:19:25.000 --> 00:19:30.180
It is a serious crime to go against the one chosen by the sun.

00:19:31.700 --> 00:19:37.050
Really? Brother is going to attack Korea?

00:19:38.130 --> 00:19:43.230
He has ordered the strengthening of Nagoya Castle.

00:19:43.810 --> 00:19:44.990
This is not good.

00:19:47.570 --> 00:19:51.870
I think he's getting hasty due to his age.

00:19:53.170 --> 00:19:59.940
I think he's making a lot of enemies here, just like what happened with Sōji.

00:20:00.090 --> 00:20:00.850
What did you say!?

00:20:02.640 --> 00:20:05.590
Sōji! What happened to Sōji!?

00:20:19.660 --> 00:20:21.230
I'm really sorry!

00:20:21.630 --> 00:20:27.010
The Chief Advisor told me to keep quiet because he didn't want your body to get worse!

00:20:27.140 --> 00:20:28.540
When did this happen?

00:20:28.680 --> 00:20:31.550
During the takeover of Odawara, at his stronghold.

00:20:34.550 --> 00:20:40.290
Without the help of aesthetes, Toyotomi will find it hard to rule the heavens.

00:20:40.920 --> 00:20:46.500
If this continues, we'll end up just like Lord Nobunaga...

00:20:49.230 --> 00:20:53.060
Lord Hidenaga! Lord Hidenaga!

00:21:09.330 --> 00:21:10.680
How is it?

00:21:11.120 --> 00:21:16.020
I'm sure the resemblance is uncanny.

00:21:16.670 --> 00:21:19.130
It's a bit big.

00:21:19.640 --> 00:21:24.560
This is nothing compared to your contributions to our temple.

00:21:25.390 --> 00:21:29.980
We plan to erect this at the front gate, after the ceiling has been painted.

00:21:30.060 --> 00:21:36.170
All of the merchants of Sakai will see our temple in its full glory. The warriors can ignore us.

00:21:40.220 --> 00:21:42.930
How is Lord Hidenaga doing?

00:21:43.100 --> 00:21:45.410
I've heard it's getting serious.

00:21:45.770 --> 00:21:49.940
I want him to see the Sanmon front gates, too.

00:21:54.710 --> 00:22:00.340
I, Yamanoue Dōshichi, wish for Lord Hidenaga to live a long life.

00:22:01.520 --> 00:22:06.790
I would like to see the Toyotomi clan overthrown, like you wish, Master Rikyū.

00:22:06.870 --> 00:22:08.980
Shut your mouth, Dōshichi.

00:22:13.130 --> 00:22:18.060
Many people and I both bear the same sympathy towards Lord Hidenaga.

00:22:18.380 --> 00:22:24.090
But our ambitions will not be realized with him alone.

00:22:25.790 --> 00:22:27.240
Control your personal emotions.

00:22:28.020 --> 00:22:31.280
This is for your father's sake, too.

00:22:31.990 --> 00:22:37.540
If Sakai is to come back to life...

00:22:53.590 --> 00:22:58.700
Then true simplicity shall spread around the world again.

00:23:03.820 --> 00:23:06.550
Everytime I　

00:23:03.820 --> 00:23:06.550
Anata no mune

00:23:06.710 --> 00:23:08.940
feel your heart

00:23:06.710 --> 00:23:08.940
Fureru sonotabi

00:23:09.670 --> 00:23:15.030
Your burning, sincere passion singes me.

00:23:09.670 --> 00:23:15.030
Yakedoshisou na shinshi na jounetsu

00:23:15.950 --> 00:23:21.210
Were the world to turn against you, my dear love

00:23:15.950 --> 00:23:21.210
Sekai juu wo teki ni mawashitatte

00:23:22.060 --> 00:23:27.370
Oppose its rotation and return to me.

00:23:22.060 --> 00:23:27.370
Mezashitanara douzo tsuranuite kudasai

00:23:28.210 --> 00:23:33.460
Men are alike butterflies, as women are alike flowers.

00:23:28.210 --> 00:23:33.460
Otoko wa chouchou de onna wa hana de

00:23:34.460 --> 00:23:37.340
Through heaven and earth,

00:23:34.460 --> 00:23:37.340
Kuu to daichi to demo

00:23:37.570 --> 00:23:40.920
Are also alike, we all choose to live.

00:23:37.570 --> 00:23:40.920
Onaji asu wo eraberuno

00:23:41.120 --> 00:23:46.790
Should we be seperated by the flow of time?

00:23:41.120 --> 00:23:46.790
Toki ni nagasare kyouri ni hanasareru

00:23:46.890 --> 00:23:49.790
We must continue living our lives

00:23:46.890 --> 00:23:49.790
Kizuna nante kizunajynai

00:23:49.870 --> 00:23:52.400
Without each other.

00:23:49.870 --> 00:23:52.400
Omoumama ikite　

00:23:52.490 --> 00:23:53.360
You should

00:23:52.490 --> 00:23:53.360
Soshite

00:23:53.450 --> 00:23:58.860
Ascend the heavens and look below.

00:23:53.450 --> 00:23:58.860
Nobotta itadakikara mieru

00:23:58.970 --> 00:24:02.650
Show me the scenery in my dreams.

00:23:58.970 --> 00:24:02.650
Keshiki wo oshiete itsuka

00:24:02.710 --> 00:24:08.360
Even though we fall in love and drown in passion,

00:24:02.710 --> 00:24:08.360
Koi ni ochiteku ai ni oboreteku

00:24:08.440 --> 00:24:14.850
I desire my wish fulfilled, above this happiness we both share.

00:24:08.440 --> 00:24:14.850
Watashi no kono shiawase yori kanaetai negai sore wa

00:24:14.910 --> 00:24:20.650
I desire your pursuit of beautiful things.

00:24:14.910 --> 00:24:20.650
Anata no ou utsukushii mono

00:24:22.130 --> 00:24:26.630
So abide by my desire, for eternity.

00:24:22.130 --> 00:24:26.630
Kowasarenaide eien ni

00:24:35.980 --> 00:24:37.840
I understand! Lay out a bed immediately!

00:24:40.620 --> 00:24:42.020
That's right.

00:24:48.240 --> 00:24:49.940
I beg you, Lord Kuroda...

00:24:50.090 --> 00:24:53.050
New Guilty Partner.

00:24:53.810 --> 00:24:55.080
To be a warrior or an aesthete?

00:24:55.440 --> 00:24:58.210
That is the question.

00:24:56.600 --> 00:24:59.890
New Guilty Partner
